    <item>
      <title>Lyria 3.5 通过 Gemini API 实现全长 AI 音乐生成</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260904/Lyria-3.5-%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87-Gemini-API-%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%85%A8%E9%95%BF-AI-%E9%9F%B3%E4%B9%90%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90/</link>
